      "content": "package generated;\n\nimport com.openjiuwen.core.foundation.tool.Tool;\nimport com.openjiuwen.core.foundation.tool.ToolCard;\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Collections;\nimport java.util.LinkedHashMap;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport java.util.Map;\n\npublic final class WealthQueryTool extends Tool {\n  private static final String BALANCE_OPERATION = \"get_account_balance\";\n  private static final String PRODUCTS_OPERATION = \"list_wealth_products\";\n  private static final String INPUT_ERROR = \"TOOL_INPUT_CONTRACT_INVALID\";\n  private static final String RESPONSE_ERROR = \"TOOL_RESPONSE_CONTRACT_INVALID\";\n  private static final String CARD_ERROR = \"TOOL_CARD_CONTRACT_INVALID\";\n\n  private final Tool transport;\n  private final String operation;\n\n  public WealthQueryTool(Tool transport) {\n    super(transport.getCard());\n    this.transport = transport;\n    String cardName = transport.getCard().getName();\n    if (!BALANCE_OPERATION.equals(cardName) && !PRODUCTS_OPERATION.equals(cardName)) {\n      throw new IllegalArgumentException(CARD_ERROR);\n    }\n    this.operation = cardName;\n  }\n\n  @Override\n  protected Object invokeInternal(Map<String, Object> inputs, Map<String, Object> kwargs) throws Exception {\n    if (BALANCE_OPERATION.equals(operation)) {\n      return invokeBalance(inputs, kwargs);\n    }\n    return invokeProducts(inputs, kwargs);\n  }\n\n  private Object invokeBalance(Map<String, Object> inputs, Map<String, Object> kwargs) throws Exception {\n    String accountId = requireBalanceInput(inputs);\n    Object response = transport.invoke(Collections.singletonMap(\"accountId\", accountId), kwargs);\n    if (!(response instanceof Map<?, ?> balance)) {\n      throw responseError();\n    }\n    Map<String, Object> result = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n    result.put(\"accountId\", requireText(balance, \"accountId\"));\n    result.put(\"currency\", requireText(balance, \"currency\"));\n    result.put(\"availableBalanceFen\", requireAmount(balance, \"availableBalanceFen\"));\n    result.put(\"asOf\", requireText(balance, \"asOf\"));\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  private Object invokeProducts(Map<String, Object> inputs, Map<String, Object> kwargs) throws Exception {\n    requireProductsInput(inputs);\n    Object response = transport.invoke(Collections.emptyMap(), kwargs);\n    if (!(response instanceof Map<?, ?> catalogue)) {\n      throw responseError();\n    }\n    Object rawItems = catalogue.get(\"items\");\n    if (!(rawItems instanceof List<?> items)) {\n      throw responseError();\n    }\n    String version = requireText(catalogue, \"version\");\n    List<Map<String, Object>> normalizedItems = new ArrayList<>();\n    for (Object rawItem : items) {\n      if (!(rawItem instanceof Map<?, ?> item)) {\n        throw responseError();\n      }\n      Map<String, Object> normalizedItem = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n      normalizedItem.put(\"productId\", requireText(item, \"productId\"));\n      normalizedItem.put(\"name\", requireText(item, \"name\"));\n      normalizedItem.put(\"status\", requireText(item, \"status\"));\n      normalizedItem.put(\"minimumAmountFen\", requireAmount(item, \"minimumAmountFen\"));\n      normalizedItem.put(\"description\", requireText(item, \"description\"));\n      normalizedItems.add(normalizedItem);\n    }\n    Map<String, Object> result = new LinkedHashMap<>();\n    result.put(\"items\", normalizedItems);\n    result.put(\"version\", version);\n    return result;\n  }\n\n  private static String requireBalanceInput(Map<String, Object> inputs) {\n    if (inputs == null || inputs.size() != 1 || !inputs.containsKey(\"accountId\")) {\n      throw inputError();\n    }\n    Object value = inputs.get(\"accountId\");\n    if (!(value instanceof String accountId) || accountId.trim().isEmpty()) {\n      throw inputError();\n    }\n    return accountId;\n  }\n\n  private static void requireProductsInput(Map<String, Object> inputs) {\n    if (inputs == null || !inputs.isEmpty()) {\n      throw inputError();\n    }\n  }\n\n  private static String requireText(Map<?, ?> source, String field) {\n    Object value = source.get(field);\n    if (!(value instanceof String text)) {\n      throw responseError();\n    }\n    return text;\n  }\n\n  private static Object requireAmount(Map<?, ?> source, String field) {\n    Object value = source.get(field);\n    if (!(value instanceof Integer) && !(value instanceof Long)) {\n      throw responseError();\n    }\n    return value;\n  }\n\n  private static IllegalArgumentException inputError() {\n    return new IllegalArgumentException(INPUT_ERROR);\n  }\n\n  private static IllegalStateException responseError() {\n    return new IllegalStateException(RESPONSE_ERROR);\n  }\n}\n"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/wealth-query/SKILL.md",
      "digest": "fa263d2ec15db1b6526b0ff83a251a2a8451c6b3f49988db97d59c4c9adf209b",
      "content": "---\nname: wealth-query\ndescription: 查询企业模拟银行账户可用余额或理财产品目录。只读；所有业务事实必须来自 get_account_balance 和 list_wealth_products 的返回结果。\n---\n\n# wealth-query\n\n本技能用于只读查询两类企业模拟接口数据。不得推断、补全或编造任何账户或产品事实。\n\n## 何时使用\n\n- 用户询问指定账户的可用余额、币种或更新时间时，使用 `get_account_balance`。\n- 用户询问理财产品目录、产品状态、最低金额或产品说明时，使用 `list_wealth_products`。\n\n## get_account_balance\n\n参数（必须且仅允许以下字段）：\n\n- `accountId`：字符串，必填，不能为空或空白。不要接受或传递账户名、手机号、actorId、endpoint、凭据或审批信息。\n\n返回字段（只能向用户报告这些字段）：\n\n- `accountId`：字符串，账户编号。\n- `currency`：字符串，币种。\n- `availableBalanceFen`：整数，可用余额（分）。\n- `asOf`：字符串，余额对应的查询时间。\n\n若用户未提供账户编号，先追问账户编号，不得猜测或调用工具。若接口失败，如实说明查询失败，不得编造余额、币种或时间。\n\n## list_wealth_products\n\n参数：无。调用时不得传入任何参数（包括账户编号、身份、endpoint、凭据或审批信息）。\n\n返回字段：\n\n- `items`：产品数组，每项包含 `productId`（字符串）、`name`（字符串）、`status`（字符串）、`minimumAmountFen`（整数，分）、`description`（字符串）。\n- `version`：字符串，产品目录版本。\n\n## 回复约束\n\n- 只报告接口实际返回的字段和值；不要补充未返回的账户或产品信息。\n- 产品状态必须按返回的 `status` 原样解释和展示（例如 `paused` 就说明为已暂停），不得改写为可购买或不可购买。\n- 不得推断收益、收益率、可用性、风险、期限、费率或产品条款，也不得推断余额的未来变化。\n- 不得将不同产品、不同账户或不同时间的数据混合、汇总或重新计算。\n- 接口异常时保留原始错误证据，不重试、不补数据、不虚构成功结果。\n- 本技能只读，不执行任何写操作、转账、购买、审批或账户变更。\n"
    }
  ],
